<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Task Taxonomy ‣ SIREN: Towards End-to-End Extreme-Weather Early Warning with Experience-Grounded LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> summarizes the 18 atomic subtasks, their abbreviations, evaluation protocols, and representative question templates.</p>
</div>
