<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Extreme Weather Events</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix B Extreme Weather Events ‣ SIREN: Towards End-to-End Extreme-Weather Early Warning with Experience-Grounded LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> defines the 12 event families covered by SIREN-Bench.</p>
</div>
