<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A6.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix F Comparative Results across States ‣ SIREN: Towards End-to-End Extreme-Weather Early Warning with Experience-Grounded LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> shows that the benefits of historical experience extend broadly across geographic regions. SIREN-RAG achieves the highest mean across the selected states for all three backbones, narrowly outperforming SIREN-Modeling with Qwen and leading more clearly with GPT and Gemini.
The remaining variation across states indicates that agent performance is not yet geographically robust across heterogeneous local conditions.</p>
</div>
